ta hai","translated":true},{"id":458,"start":983.69,"end":983.81,"text":"Aasateeri","translated":true},{"id":459,"start":983.69,"end":983.81,"text":"m 0 0 l 400 0 400 85 0 85","translated":true},{"id":460,"start":983.69,"end":983.81,"text":"Buri halaton se bachav","translated":true},{"id":461,"start":983.69,"end":983.81,"text":"Jab zindagi 1 ho, 5 Second ke liye\nnuksan se suraksha aur amarpan milta hai","translated":true},{"id":462,"start":983.81,"end":983.94,"text":"Aasateeri","translated":true},{"id":463,"start":983.81,"end":983.94,"text":"m 0 0 l 400 0 400 85 0 85","translated":true},{"id":464,"start":983.81,"end":983.94,"text":"Buri halaton se bachav","translated":true},{"id":465,"start":983.81,"end":983.94,"text":"Jab zindagi 1 ho, 5 Second ke liye\nnuksan se suraksha aur amarpan milta hai","translated":true},{"id":466,"start":983.94,"end":984.06,"text":"Aasateeri","translated":true},{"id":467,"start":983.94,"end":984.06,"text":"m 0 0 l 400 0 400 85 0 85","translated":true},{"id":468,"start":983.94,"end":984.06,"text":"Buri halaton se bachav","translated":true},{"id":469,"start":983.94,"end":984.06,"text":"Jab zindagi 1 ho, 5 Second ke liye\nnuksan se suraksha aur amarpan milta hai","translated":true},{"id":470,"start":984.06,"end":985.53,"text":"Aasateeri","translated":true},{"id":471,"start":984.06,"end":985.53,"text":"m 0 0 l 400 0 400 85 0 85","translated":true},{"id":472,"start":984.06,"end":985.53,"text":"Buri halaton se bachav","translated":true},{"id":473,"start":984.06,"end":985.53,"text":"Jab zindagi 1 ho, 5 Second ke liye\nnuksan se suraksha aur amarpan milta hai","translated":true},{"id":474,"start":985.53,"end":988.24,"text":"Mai dil se shukriguzar Hu ki tu meri\nmadad ko taiyar hai.","translated":true},{"id":475,"start":988.24,"end":989.2,"text":"Mai nahi karunga.","translated":true},{"id":476,"start":990.88,"end":991.53,"text":"Tu karega kya?","translated":true},{"id":477,"start":991.53,"end":992.45,"text":"Mai nahi karunga.","translated":true},{"id":478,"start":992.45,"end":994.58,"text":"Kya tu chahta hai Mai akela Unn sab se\nladoon?","translated":true},{"id":479,"start":994.58,"end":995.79,"text":"Yeh mera kaam nahi hai!","translated":true},{"id":480,"start":995.79,"end":997.16,"text":"Meherbani kar! Mai haath jodta Hu.","translated":true},{"id":481,"start":997.16,"end":999.25,"text":"Miss-sahiba ki jaan khatre mein hai!","translated":true},{"id":541,"start":1165.66,"end":1168.88,"text":"B-badtameezi ki bhi had hoti hai!","translated":true},{"id":542,"start":1171.34,"end":1173.7,"text":"Lagta hai Woh poori taiyari se ladenge.","translated":true},{"id":543,"start":1174.3,"end":1176.51,"text":"...O anjaan saahsi musafir!","translated":true},{"id":544,"start":1176.73,"end":1179.05,"text":"Mai dushmanon ko rokunga.","translated":true},{"id":545,"start":1179.05,"end":1183.22,"text":"Iss mauke ka fayda uthao aur meri\nmemsaab... Irene-sama ko bachao!","translated":true},{"id":546,"start":1183.22,"end":1185.91,"text":"Nahi, chahe kitni bhi Takat ho, akela\nnahi saamna kar sakte!","translated":true},{"id":547,"start":1185.91,"end":1187.01,"text":"...Ek din","translated":true},{"id":548,"start":1187.49,"end":1189.52,"text":"Tum samajh jaoge.","translated":true},{"id":549,"start":1190.38,"end":1191.48,"text":"Yeh lo Mai aaya!","translated":true},{"id":550,"start":1192.3,"end":1193.88,"text":"Khatam kar Dunga!","translated":true},{"id":551,"start":1202.81,"end":1204.69,"text":"...O Yatan ke bachon!","translated":true},{"id":552,"start":1204.69,"end":1206.29,"text":"Maut ho Iss kafir ke liye!","translated":true},{"id":553,"start":1206.29,"end":1208.25,"text":"Itni jaldi wapas kaise aa gaye?","translated":true},{"id":554,"start":1208.25,"end":1210.81,"text":"Grid, Mai yeh nahi kar sakta!","translated":true},{"id":555,"start":1210.81,"end":1211.42,"text":"Kamzor kahin ke!","translated":true},{"id":556,"start":1212.38,"end":1214.91,"text":"Ladhai ke dauran dhyan rakhna chahiye.","translated":true},{"id":557,"start":1214.91,"end":1216.6,"text":"Iss baar mar jaoge.","translated":true},{"id":558,"start":1216.82,"end":1218.34,"text":"Andheri toofani taaqat!","translated":true},{"id":559,"start":1221.3,"end":1222.8,"text":"M-mujhe bhi lapet lega!","translated":true},{"id":560,"start":1252.11,"end":1254.34,"text":"Roku isko?","translated":true},{"id":561,"start":1255.2,"end":1257.19,"text":"Meri health... sirf ek?","translated":true},{"id":562,"start":1257.69,"end":1258.96,"text":"...Kya yeh wahi hai","translated":true},{"id":563,"start":1259.54,"end":1261.97,"text":"Legendary","translated":true},{"id":564,"start":1259.54,"end":1261.97,"text":"Title ki khasiyat","translated":true},{"id":565,"start":1259.54,"end":1261.97,"text":"Negative sthitiyon se bachav","translated":true},{"id":566,"start":1259.54,"end":1261.97,"text":"Jab life 1 ho, 5 second tak damage nahi\nhota","translated":true},{"id":567,"start":1259.54,"end":1261.97,"text":"Aur amarkata","translated":true},{"id":568,"start":1259.8,"end":1261.97,"text":"Yeh immortal skill jo mujhe mere title se\nmili hai?","translated":true},{"id":569,"start":1262.3,"end":1264.93,"text":"B-bach gaya!","translated":true},{"id":570,"start":1265.53,"end":1268.68,"text":"Kaun ho tum?","translated":true},{"id":571,"start":1270,"end":1271.39,"text":"...Mera naam","translated":true},{"id":572,"start":1273.47,"end":1274.62,"text":"...Maine bataya tha na","translated":true},{"id":573,"start":1274.62,"end":1277.36,"text":"Jo pehle aage badhta hai wahi jeet ta hai!","translated":true},{"id":574,"start":1277.89,"end":1280.03,"text":"Rakshak ki dhal!","translated":true},{"id":575,"start":1280.32,"end":1282.49,"text":"Abhi bhi itni Takat bachi hai?","translated":true},{"id":576,"start":1287.64,"end":1288.98,"text":"Game se bahar niklein?","translated":true},{"id":577,"start":1296.34,"end":1297.34,"text":"Tum mar chuke ho","translated":true},{"id":578,"start":1296.9,"end":1300.62,"text":"S-rank quest fail hone ki wajah se tumhara\nlevel do point gir gaya hai.","translated":true},{"id":579,"start":1302.34,"end":1305.17,"text":"Tumhara Current level minus 3 hai.","translated":true},{"id":580,"start":1305.17,"end":1307.88,"text":"Kyunki tum 24 ghante mein do baar Maare ho,","translated":true},{"id":581,"start":1307.88,"end":1310.27,"text":"Isliye agle 12 ghante tak game mein nahi\naa sakoge.","translated":true},{"id":582,"start":1310.27,"end":1313.52,"text":"Uss haraamzaade Grid ne mujhe hi apno ke\nbeech marwa diya!","translated":true},{"id":583,"start":1313.52,"end":1315.98,"text":"Lekin asal mein, yeh sab Yura ki galti\nhai!","translated":true},{"id":584,"start":1316.44,"end":1319.4,"text":"Mat socho ki Mai bas ek nakamyab insaan\nHu!","translated":true},{"id":585,"start":1319.58,"end":1325.37,"text":"Nagamine Sabzi Bhandar","translated":true},{"id":586,"start":1320.17,"end":1321.3,"text":"Takumi!","translated":true},{"id":587,"start":1321.3,"end":1322.63,"text":"Pata hai kitna baj gaya hai?","translated":true},{"id":588,"start":1321.72,"end":1323.9,"text":"Bhaiya!","translated":true},{"id":589,"start":1322.63,"end":1325.37,"text":"...Sone do mujhe, meherbani karke.","translated":true},{"id":590,"start":1325.37,"end":1327.33,"text":"Nagamine Sabzi Bhandar","translated":true},{"id":591,"start":1327.63,"end":1328.92,"text":"Khush ki khabrein!","translated":true},{"id":592,"start":1328.92,"end":1332.29,"text":"Aaj Humare Pass game ke andar se reporter\nSumita ki report hai.","translated":true},{"id":593,"start":1332.29,"end":1336.71,"text":"Yatan Temple ke bhoot ka aana!","translated":true},{"id":594,"start":1332.62,"end":1333.75,"text":"Isko dekho zara.","translated":true},{"id":595,"start":1333.75,"end":1337.31,"text":"Kal raat, yahin Eternal kingdom ke North\nmein sthit Yatan Temple mein,","translated":true},{"id":596,"start":1337.31,"end":1339.62,"text":"Bohari tarah se dhwasth hua hai!","translated":true},{"id":597,"start":1338.38,"end":1346.39,"text":"Yatan Temple ke bhoot ka aana!","translated":true},{"id":598,"